  "instructions": {
    "zh": "先在心里选定近四周一个较常参与的普通领域，例如一门课程、一项兴趣活动或一类日常共同任务；整份题目沿用同一个领域，不必把领域名称输入网站。按每句话在该领域实际出现的频率，从1从不到5几乎总是选择；没有情境、资料不足或不愿回答都可选NA。24条原创题分别观察自主、胜任、联结的满足与受阻体验，各4条、至少3条有效才显示一位小数均分。六项分别保留；受阻题不反向，低满足不自动等于高受阻，不相减或合成总分，也不派固定动机类型。它不判断他人的真实意图、能力、健康、职业适配或你为何采取某个行动。",
    "en": "Choose in your mind one ordinary area you took part in over the past four weeks, such as a course, an interest activity or a kind of shared everyday task. Keep the same area throughout; do not enter its name on the website. Rate how often each statement occurred there from 1 Never to 5 Almost always. Choose NA for absent context, insufficient information or declining to answer. Twenty-four original items separately explore satisfaction and frustration experiences for autonomy, competence and relatedness. Each four-item part needs three ratings for a one-decimal mean. Keep all six parts separate: frustration is not reverse-scored, low satisfaction does not automatically mean high frustration, and there is no subtraction, total or fixed motivation type. The reflection determines no other person’s actual intention, ability, health, career fit or reason for your actions."
